{
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:00:08",
      "utterance": "こんにちは。相談員です。",
      "tag": "Greeting"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:01:07",
      "utterance": "よろしくお願いします",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:03:02",
      "utterance": "では、相談を始めます。はじめに、年齢、性別、相談内容を教えてください。",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:03:29",
      "utterance": "20代、男性、仕事がなかなか決まりません",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:06:27",
      "utterance": "ええ、そうだったのですね。今は、心配や、不安などどういったお気持ちでしょうか",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:07:10",
      "utterance": "このままだと貯金が減るばかりで不安です",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:09:42",
      "utterance": "はい、不安になりますよね。今は就職活動をされているのでしょうか。",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:09:57",
      "utterance": "はい。ハローワークに通っていましか",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:10:02",
      "utterance": "います",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:11:00",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。いつ頃からハローワークに通っていらっしゃるのですか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:11:12",
      "utterance": "半年前からです",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:15:25",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですね。先が見えないと不安ですよね。職種や雇用形態等の希望があるのですか。",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:16:08",
      "utterance": "特にありません",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:16:51",
      "utterance": "早く働きたいというお気持ちが強いのですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:16:56",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:18:35",
      "utterance": "ハローワークの方にお話ししたりはされていますか。",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:18:42",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:19:31",
      "utterance": "何かアドバイスなどがあったりしましたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:19:49",
      "utterance": "まずは面接を受けに行くようにと言われました",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:20:38",
      "utterance": "どうせダメだと思うのに",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:20:52",
      "utterance": "ええ、そのようにお話があったのですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:21:13",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。なぜそのように思うのですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:21:53",
      "utterance": "人前に出ると何を話して良いかわからなくなるんです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:22:57",
      "utterance": "はい、色々考えたり、緊張してしまうんですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:23:26",
      "utterance": "いろんなこと考えてしまい言葉になりません",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:26:19",
      "utterance": "ええ、対面でかしこまっているのでより緊張しますよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:26:26",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:26:52",
      "utterance": "面接の事を考えると、応募をためらってしまうという事ですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:27:57",
      "utterance": "はじめは応募していたのですが、不採用通知が来るのがもう嫌なんです",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:32:07",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですか。うまくいかないことが続くとつらいですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:32:39",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:33:58",
      "utterance": "どうしたら、また面接に行けるようになると思いますか。",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:34:50",
      "utterance": "自信がついたら、かなあ",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:37:57",
      "utterance": "ええ、自信は大切ですよね。他にこういった気持ちになればいいなということはありますか。",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:39:04",
      "utterance": "相手がにこやかだったら",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:40:00",
      "utterance": "そうですよね。かしこまった雰囲気よりも話しやすいですよね。ハローワークで面接の練習などはありますか。",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:40:23",
      "utterance": "わかりません",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2022-06-19T14:41:52",
      "utterance": "うまくすすめられずすみませんでした。お疲れさまでした。ありがとうございました。",
      "tag": "Other"
    }
  ],
